    "title": "Contractor charged with fraud in Columbia Co. heads to trial - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Samantha Calderon ,\n5 hours ago PORTAGE, Wis. — A 40-year-old contractor charged with fraud in Columbia County is now heading to trial, online court records show. Frederick Burdick, of La Valle, is charged with theft in a business setting of between $5,000 and $10,000 involving an elder victim and theft by a contractor of between $5,000 and $10,000 involving an elder victim. Read full article",
